&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave for primary carers (6 for secondary)&lt;/strong&gt; — becoming a parent is life changing and we&#39;re committed to supporting you and your family through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A remote-work allowance&lt;/strong&gt; for home-office kit, co-working, or working elsewhere — we want you to have everything you need to be set up for success in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confidential EAP &amp;amp; mental health support&lt;/strong&gt; — sometimes life gets hard. You should be able to access the resources and support you need.&lt;/li&gt;
